flowchart TD
    Start([PR Created / Synchronized]) --> Pipeline[PR Orchestrator Pipeline\n.github/workflows/pr-pipeline.yml]

    subgraph Stage1 [Stage 1: Pre-Flight & Syntax Validation ~30s]
        Pipeline --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeeper\n.github/workflows/pr-gatekeeper.yml\nBranch name & PR template]
        Gate -->|Pass| Lint[2. Polyglot Linters\n.github/workflows/pr-lint.yml\nSuper-Linter / ESLint / Prettier]
        Gate -->|Fail| GateFail[Apply 'needs-metadata'\nHalt pipeline]
        Lint -->|Fail| LintFail[Apply 'lint-failed'\nHalt pipeline]
    end

    subgraph Stage2 [Stage 2: Compilation & Build ~30s]
        Lint -->|Pass| Build[3. Build Verification\n.github/workflows/pr-build.yml\nTypeScript, Go, Rust, .NET, Java]
        Build -->|Fail| BuildFail[Apply 'build-failed'\nHalt pipeline]
    end

    subgraph Stage3 [Stage 3: Deep Verification in Parallel ~1-2m]
        Build -->|Pass| ParallelStage{Parallel Execution}
        ParallelStage --> Test[4. Automated Tests & Coverage\n.github/workflows/pr-test.yml\nDiff-scoped >= 80% coverage]
        ParallelStage --> Sec[5. Security & Quality\n.github/workflows/pr-security.yml\nCodeQL SAST, Dep Review, Secrets]
        ParallelStage --> DocEval[6. Semantic Doc Evaluation\n.github/workflows/pr-doc-updater.md\ngh-aw agentic evaluator]
    end

    %% Direct fix loops (no stacked PR)
    GateFail --> AgentMeta[🤖 PR Validation Agent\nUpdates title & description via API] --> Start
    LintFail --> AgentLint[🤖 PR Lint Fixer\nPushes formatting fix directly to branch] --> Start

    %% Stacked PR remediation loops (auto-merged)
    Test -->|< 80% Coverage| CovFail[Apply 'test-required'] --> AgentTest[🤖 PR Test Generator\nOpens Stacked PR]
    Sec -->|Vulnerabilities| SecFail[Apply 'codeql-alert' / 'dependency-alert'] --> AgentSec[🤖 PR Security Fixers\nOpens Stacked PR]
    DocEval -->|Docs Missing for APIs| DocFail[Apply 'docs-required'] --> AgentDoc[🤖 PR Documentation Updater\nOpens Stacked PR]

    AgentTest & AgentSec & AgentDoc --> StackedPR[Stacked PR on Feature Branch\nTagged: test/doc/security-remediation]
    StackedPR --> AutoMerge[Auto-Merge Stacked PR into Feature Branch\n.github/workflows/pr-stacked-merge.yml\nSquash, delete branch, clear labels, post audit link]
    AutoMerge --> Start

    %% Review Stage
    Test & Sec & DocEval -->|All Gates Pass & Labels Cleared| Stage4[Stage 4: PR Review Dispatcher\n.github/workflows/pr-review-dispatcher.yml]
    Stage4 --> PostSummary[Post Consolidated Summary on PR\nAudit links to all auto-merged fixes]
    Stage4 --> AICodeReview[Request GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI architectural & semantic analysis]
    AICodeReview --> HumanReview[Developer Final Sign-Off & Review\nSingle review session for all changes]
    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge PR into Main])
